ón para cocinar y servir pastel de camote, relleno de castañas y budín de pan con bourbon. Las asas de lazo en la fuente y en la tapa añaden un detalle divertido y hacen que llevarla y servir sea seguro y fácil. Sólida pero elegante, la fuente es apta para horno, congelador, microondas y lavavajillas, lo que hace muy sencillo preparar, cocinar, guardar y limpiar.","dept":"casa_cocina","retailer":"crateandbarrel","weightKg":2.75,"url":"https://www.crateandbarrel.com/lucerne-1-quart-casserole-dish/s335371"}],"metal desk lamp, adjustable goose neck architect table lamp with on/off switch, eye-caring reading lamp for bedroom, study room & office":[{"name":"Metal Desk Lamp, Adjustable Goose Neck Architect Table Lamp with On/Off Switch, Eye-Caring Reading Lamp for Bedroom, Study Room & Office","price":19.99,"image":"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Metal-Desk-Lamp-Adjustable-Goose-Neck-Architect-Table-Lamp-with-On-Off-Switch-Eye-Caring-Reading-Lamp-for-Bedroom-Study-Room-Office_4d6875a5-e4bf-4e35-becc-975a730ca1cf.6dfc2b05375e0d1438fcb97d45e8bba7.jpeg","dept":"small_home","retailer":"walmart","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Metal-Desk-Lamp-Adjustable-Goose-Neck-Architect-Table-Lamp-with-On-Off-Switch-Eye-Caring-Reading-Lamp-for-Bedroom-Study-Room-Office/20960001837?classType=VARIANT"}],"mini brands really works magic cook kitchen serie 1 (maquina de helados) de zuru, para ninos de 3 anos en adelante":[{"name":"Mini Brands Really Works Magic Cook Kitchen serie 1 (máquina de helados) de ZURU, para niños de 3 años en adelante","price":9.97,"image":"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/MCK-ICE-CREAM-MAKER_d25f96ce-9f09-4ab6-9880-756fb5cbf34c.c453348d4855aca76ab4d4f70945afda.jpeg","description":"Perfecto para diversión en interiores: ¡juguetes Mini Brands! Lindos diseños que alegran tu cuarto de juegos.","dept":"toys","retailer":"walmart","weightKg":0.3,"url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/MCK-ICE-CREAM-MAKER/17405651114?classType=REGULAR"}],"narciso poudree — eau de parfum en spra